In this update, we delved into the technical part: we fixed bugs, worked with game mechanics, so there is very little time and effort left for new content, but we cannot leave you completely without surprises!

Content update:

⚔️Weapon
  ―   Added 3 new "claws" for Bjorn (When calculating, we found that  ―   Percival had slightly more different two-handed weapons than Bjorn's paired ones, we fixed this terrible misunderstanding)

🛡Sets
  ―  Added 3 new sets of things! Find them in the game to find out more :slight_smile:
  ―   Sets are now tied to certain biomes (with the exception of chests and merchants - anything can drop here).

Now, having some part of the set, you can plan your trip and increase the chance to collect exactly what you need.

 ―  Reworked the rarity of sets. Now each set always consists of: 1st common, 3x rare and 1st legendary items;
 ―  In the bonus from the set "Lunar druid" x2, the starting bonus is now taken into account - regeneration from things; 
―  Fixed bonus from the x5 elven set: an attack with the "thorns" effect does not miss the opponents;

⚖️Balance:
 ―  Potions of healing now heal 25% of the maximum health of the character;
 ―  "Elven Ale" now gives 2 Evasions instead of 3; 
 ―  Changed the cost of items: rare items are slightly cheaper than before, and legendary items are slightly more expensive;
 ―  Cards in the weapon "Spiked club" are replaced with the card "Sepsis";
 ―  Buff "Hot Potato" does not disappear after the death of the owner and is activated only by attacks, skills and talents;
 ―  Changed the set of items from merchants;
 ―  Added the probability of falling out of an ordinary item after a normal battle;
 ―  Now you can not stun zombies when respawning;

