The major change of this patch lies in the addition of two large mechanics. 

Now we are testing new skills and improvements system as well as difficulty levels. In this patch we have tried to add the completed version of the above-mentioned innovations along with updated interface. This version is not final. We will refine it and make necessary corrections based on your feedback. 

So, other changes: 

Fixes: 

 Changed intentions of some units. 
 Changed “slot check” mechanics. It works when you try to wear some item; 
 Spiky Helmet value was increased to 240 gold; 
 “Dash” application mechanic was changed. Now it fits the description;
 We have reworked ”Champion's "Stroke" of the “Champion”; 
 "Parry" is now a card of "Attack" class;
 Fixed all the “Stun” card bugs; 
 Fixed bug with cards freezing during the battle with “Millenis”; 
 Fixed mechanics of maximum health points changing at the end of a battle.
 Fixed bug with cards freezing during their elimination from the "burned" deck;


Adding: 

 Now you can check a mechanic’s description. It’s necessary to hover your cursor over the word you are interested in;
 Added the description of "Stun” mechanics;
 Added new "Pacifist" achievement; 
 New localization version;
 New event: "Egg-laying" in Steppe location; 


Keep in mind that the new leveling system is now only available on a test game build. It's necessary to change it manually. To do this, go to the Steam library, right-click on Knock on the Coffin Lid → Properties → Beta → select "level_test".

Saves made on the test version will not work correctly on the main build, and may cause critical errors. It is recommended to start a new game after switching to the main version of the game.

Thank you for staying with us.
